    Zone, to its owner's Extra Deck face-up, and if you do, Special Summon this card.
    You can only use this effect of \"Antihuman Intelligence ME-PSY-YA\" once per
    turn. If another monster(s) is Normal or Special Summoned while you control this
    card: Send that monster(s) to the GY during the End Phase of this turn."
